# "From anywhere": on turn 4 Bot2's Thoughtseize makes Bot1 discard Giver of Runes, which goes from Bot1's hand to
# the graveyard. Bot1 flashes in Night Nurse in Bot2's second main phase, and the Giver, put there this turn from the
# hand rather than from the battlefield, is the target and returns to Bot1's hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Plains
Giver of Runes
Night Nurse, Healer of Heroes
Plains x3
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Thoughtseize
Swamp x4
Swamp x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Thoughtseize.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Choose(Giver of Runes)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Graveyard = Giver of Runes
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Night Nurse, Healer of Heroes.Cast

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Giver of Runes; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains
Bot1.Graveyard = 
Bot1.Battlefield = Night Nurse, Healer of Heroes; Plains; Plains
